  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n・{通学|つうがく}する (to commute to school)\n・〜で{通学|つうがく}する (to commute to school by ~)\n・{通学|つうがく}に〜かかる (it takes ~ to commute to school)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUND WORDS:\n・{通学|つうがく}{路|ろ} (route to school)\n・{通学|つうがく}{定期|ていき} (student commuter pass)\n・{通学|つうがく}{時間|じかん} (commute time to school)\n・{徒歩|とほ}{通学|つうがく} (walking to school)\n・{自転車|じてんしゃ}{通学|つうがく} (cycling to school)\n\nRELATED WORD:\n・{通勤|つうきん}: Commuting to work (same pattern, different destination)",
